(>> 3.1 Function Architecture, Prototypes and Parameter Passing) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(Modular programming decomposes complex engineering algorithms into reusable, testable) Tj
T*
(subroutines.) Tj
T*
(* Anatomy of a Function: Return type, function identifier, formal parameter list,) Tj
T*
(local variable declarations, and function body.) Tj
T*
(* Function Prototype \(Declaration\): Informs compiler about function signature \(return) Tj
T*
(type, parameter types, count\) before actual definition: int calculateArea\(int width,) Tj
T*
(int height\);. Enables type checking and implicit conversions.) Tj
T*
(* Call-by-Value vs. Call-by-Reference:) Tj
T*
(- Call-by-Value: Default in C. Actual arguments are evaluated and values copied) Tj
T*
(into separate formal parameter memory locations. Modifications made inside) Tj
T*
(function do NOT affect caller's actual arguments.) Tj
T*
(- Call-by-Reference \(Simulated via Pointers\): Caller passes memory addresses) Tj
T*
(\(&var\). Formal parameters are declared as pointers \(*ptr\). Function dereferences) Tj
T*
(pointers to directly mutate caller's original memory.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(>> 3.2 Recursion and Call Stack Mechanics) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Recursive Function: A function that calls itself either directly or indirectly.) Tj
T*
(Requires two components: \(1\) Base Case \(terminating condition returning without) Tj
T*
(recursion\), \(2\) Recursive Step \(reduces problem instance closer to base case\).) Tj
T*
(* Execution Stack Trace: Each function call allocates an Activation Record \(Stack) Tj
T*
(Frame\) on call stack containing parameters, local variables, and return address. Once) Tj
T*
(base case is reached, stack frames unwind in Last-In-First-Out \(LIFO\) order.) Tj
T*
(* Tail Recursion: Recursive call is tail-recursive if it is the very last operation) Tj
T*
(executed, allowing compiler optimization \(Tail Call Optimization TCO\) to reuse stack) Tj
T*
(frames and avoid stack overflow.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(>> 3.3 Storage Classes and Variable Scope) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* auto: Default for local variables declared inside blocks. Stored on Stack. Scope) Tj
T*
(local to block; lifetime ends upon block exit. Default value is garbage.) Tj
T*
(* register: Requests compiler to store variable in high-speed CPU core register.) Tj
T*
(Cannot use address-of operator \(&\) on register variables.) Tj
T*
(* static: Local static variables retain values between successive function calls.) Tj
T*
(Initialized only ONCE at program startup. Stored in Data Segment \(BSS if) Tj
T*
(uninitialized\). Global static functions/variables have internal linkage \(restricted) Tj
T*
(strictly to declaring file\).) Tj
T*
(* extern: Declares a global variable or function defined in another source file.) Tj
T*
