(Tail-recursive optimization, and analyze stack memory overhead.) Tj
T*
(Source Code:) Tj
T*
(#include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
(long long factorialStandard\(int n\) {) Tj
T*
(if \(n <= 1\) return 1;) Tj
T*
(return n * factorialStandard\(n - 1\);) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
(long long factorialTail\(int n, long long accumulator\) {) Tj
T*
(if \(n <= 1\) return accumulator;) Tj
T*
(return factorialTail\(n - 1, n * accumulator\);) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
(int main\(\) {) Tj
T*
(int val = 6;) Tj
T*
(printf\("Standard Factorial\(%d\): %lld\\n", val, factorialStandard\(val\)\);) Tj
T*
(printf\("Tail Recursive Factorial\(%d\): %lld\\n", val, factorialTail\(val, 1\)\);) Tj
T*
(return 0;) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
(Stack Trace for factorialStandard\(4\):) Tj
T*
(Call 1: fact\(4\) -> waits for 4 * fact\(3\)) Tj
T*
(Call 2: fact\(3\) -> waits for 3 * fact\(2\)) Tj
T*
(Call 3: fact\(2\) -> waits for 2 * fact\(1\)) Tj
T*
(Call 4: fact\(1\) -> returns 1 \(Base Case reached\).) Tj
T*
(Unwind 3: returns 2 * 1 = 2.) Tj
T*
(Unwind 2: returns 3 * 2 = 6.) Tj
T*
(Unwind 1: returns 4 * 6 = 24. Result = 24.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
