T*
(* C uses call-by-value by default; call-by-reference is simulated by passing pointer) Tj
T*
(addresses.) Tj
T*
(* Recursion requires a strictly reachable base case to prevent stack overflow.) Tj
T*
(* static variables retain their values across function calls; stored in data segment.) Tj
T*
(* extern enables sharing global variables across multiple compilation units.) Tj
T*
